    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrMlRTdmxOWEJhZndPWUo4ekdRTkdZV1h4XzQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.02 #校园暴力：我被评为全班最丑的女生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63721195165a4944db497ba2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63721195165a4944db497ba2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Nov 2022 09:59:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听硬核故事会。【故事会】在北京、上海、深圳三城有线下演出，本档播客是演出的实况录音，声音质量有待提高，还请见谅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期故事会的主题是#校园暴力#</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：子龙</span><a href="https://m.weibo.cn/u/1660742641?uid=1660742641&amp;t=0&amp;luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=100103type%3D1%26q%3D%E5%AD%90%E9%BE%99%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%8F%E8%82%A5" data-url="https://m.weibo.cn/u/1660742641?uid=1660742641&amp;t=0&amp;luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=100103type%3D1%26q%3D%E5%AD%90%E9%BE%99%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%8F%E8%82%A5"><span>@子龙在减肥</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：脸脸 、finn</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事1：我曾是校园暴力的施暴者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 平替王建国：别人第一眼见我就觉得我是“施暴者”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> “我总觉得别人在背后说我坏话”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 耳边总是想起爸妈的话“别找事，咱家赔不起”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 如果可以，请你对抗暴力保护别人</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事2：我被评为全班最丑的女生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 初一开学，我被告知“你是全班长得最丑的女生”。这是长达三年，校园霸凌的开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 那些嘲笑我的人，如今可能已经成为了很优秀的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> “校园暴力”除了那些显而易见的伤害，还有很多被默认的“忽视”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 我也尝试过去求助，但没用...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 依然是突然的结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们还有</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/305136663/channel/collectiondetail?sid=743878" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/305136663/channel/collectiondetail?sid=743878"><span>硬核故事会的视频版，</span></a><span>欢迎收看！</span></p>]]></description>
