    <title>EP.01 #人间骗局：骗婚者与杀猪盘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6368f3650d8d43263ef8cc66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6368f3650d8d43263ef8cc66</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Nov 2022 12:00:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听硬核故事会。【故事会】在北京、上海、深圳三城有线下演出，本档播客是演出的实况录音，声音质量有待提高，还请见谅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期故事会的主题是#人间骗局#</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：大雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：谷安</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小发</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>本期你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 观众分享自己被骗的各种奇葩经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 大雄讲述在反诈中心的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 问：pc是先给钱还是后给钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 骗婚男跟我约会之后，第二天他就去结婚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 不争气的闺蜜系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 不好意思的贴了下标签，如果他喜欢穿白色长筒袜、热衷涂眼霜、喜欢 Lana Del Rey蔡依林，那么...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 可以爱看小时代甄嬛传，但是不能演！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 我男朋友喜欢戴很紧的颈链，很喜欢模仿“老奶奶”是直的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 当杀猪盘遇到广告人，谁先套路谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 垂死病中惊坐起，别TM给我用宋体！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 微信账号异常？哦是因为打麻将转帐。（学到了！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a> 突然结尾</span></p>]]></description>
